1. If there have been no other artifacts generated, you still get one
guaranteed-to-deliver artifact wish even after you get the Staff of
Aesculapius. Note that, IIRC, if you've already been to the bottom of
the Quest, the Staff already counts towards the "created artifacts"
number, even if you haven't retrieved it from the quest nemesis yet,
so you might as well get it if you are ready to take on the Cyclops.
2. I don't think there is a gravestone, but the inventory should be at
the bottom of the water square. Freeze the water in the square (and
all the adjacent squares), or fill them in with boulders, and then dig
down; or, if it's a one-square pool, evaporate the water with a wand
of fire (may take a couple zaps). The stuff will be in the pit thus
created. Alternately, wear an amulet of magical breathing and take a
walk in the water.


